/* ===== v64k-matchlike-next-global-font.css ===== */
/* ==========================================================================
   INCA STATS PRO · V4.27.64K
   MATCH-LIKE NEXT FIXTURE + GLOBAL V27.16 TYPOGRAPHY

   BASE: V64J
   - no data logic changes;
